+     "old": "- Not decided: whether a promotion is a play, a command of the memory tool, or a memory update aimed at Garura or Phoenix memory.",
+     "new": "- Not decided: whether a promotion is a play, a command of the memory tool, or a memory update aimed at Garura memory."
