+# "Needs" and "identified by" link capabilities
+
+Functionality: a capability or functionality can need, and be identified by, another capability or functionality — any mix. Never on work (feature, story, spike, chore, bug). The spine field is still `depends_on`; renaming it to `needs` across the files that use it (53 today) is part of this story.
+
+## Agent intent (ICE)
+- Goal: Anyone can see what a node needs and what led us to find it.
+- Limit: Links sit only on capabilities and functionalities.
+- Fails if: a need or identified-by link points at work, or at a node that does not exist.
+- Checked by: the spine linter rejects a link to a story and accepts capability → functionality.
+
+## Links
+- Serves: #722
+- Identified by: found on its own
+
+Design: `.garura/project/issues/621/specs/plan-design.md` and `change-list.md` (agreed with the product owner, 2026-10-21).
