+- line 14: `"Needs" and "identified by" link capabilities and features (fn-725) renames it` becomes `Link the parts by the map's rules (fn-725), in Manage the model, renames it`.
+- line 42: "- Not decided: whether a feature's own needs count too, as the page of fn-725 says, or only the needs of its capability, as the ontology says." becomes "- Only the needs of a feature's capability count, never a feature's own. The reason, in the product owner's words: \"a feature doesn't need another feature. All of that is managed in the slices.\""
+- line 54: `Product model owns them: "Needs" and "identified by" link capabilities and features (fn-725).` becomes `Manage the model, in Product model, owns them: Link the parts by the map's rules (fn-725).`
