+- Scope: In: proposing and declaring the environments of the whole project, with each one's name, place, data, size, network, who can reach it and own settings. Out: building and managing each environment, updating the declarations, the path and what each environment is for, the tests in each, the one design of the underlying technology, the cloud and the cost, the dev sandbox on a builder's machine, the product profile, production, and moving a memory update into Phoenix memory.
