+| SEC-18 | P2 | `grep:(\bisAdmin\b\|\bhasRole\s*\(\|\bhasPermission\s*\(\|\.can\s*\(\|\brole\s*==)` | file, line, snippet (permission code only: isAdmin, hasRole(, hasPermission(, .can(, a role == test; not the plain word role) |
