+| ARCH-07 | P2 | `grep:(localhost:\|127\.0\.0\.1\|https?://[a-z]+\.\|sk_live_\|api\.example)` | file, line, snippet |
+| ARCH-08 | P3 | `path:**/*.{js,ts,py,go}` | file |
