+# BI-4 capability 4: the product owner's words and approvals
+
+Business intent BI-4 (Code → Validation). Capability 4: Test accessibility, against the product profile's accessibility level and each surface's accessibility guideline.
+His words are kept as given; quotes on pages tidy only the spelling.
+
