+     "new": "It matters because \"Agents now make more in one run than a pull request can show.\", and because, in the product owner's words, \"agents can only work on things which are approved.\" It sits in software delivery planning with Ship every change the same way, and the domain's first paragraph says so. It works in the project, on the run's branch and in Argus, and production is never touched."
