+# BI-9 capability 1: the write plan, shown to the product owner (not applied)
+
+2026-11-11. Orchestrate agent work through planning and its 11 features, all approved (page-approvals.md). The index tool's new updates (#1037, merged and installed) make the take-in possible.
+
+## Order of the runs (each through product-os-keeper and its skills)
+1. enrich-grounding, named lines: the five lines below, so no page names an old part or path that goes.
+2. link-model-part, run 1: `thin: false` on fn-729, fn-806, fn-628 and fn-795 (the page skill will not replace a thin page).
+3. enrich-grounding, approved mode: the 24 approved pages (capability page and ICE; 6 new features and their ICE; fn-729, fn-806, fn-628, fn-730 and fn-795 replaced where they sit, each with a new ice.md).
+4. link-model-part, run 2: the new capability under software delivery planning, serving bi-9; the 6 new features under it; one-lines for the 5 old features from the capability page's feature list; 12 ICE entries (3 thin: choose-next-item, work-out-waits-on, pause-plan), fn-795's ICE listed before its move; fn-795 filed under the new capability with its page and ICE moved to orchestrate-agent-work/fn-795/; fn-931 filed under Turn intents into agent work (BI-1), its page staying in features/fn-931/.
+5. remove-model-part: repoint bi-717 to bi-9 on cap-719, cap-720, fn-729, fn-806, fn-628 and fn-730; bi-788 to bi-9 on cap-shape-slice and fn-795; bi-717 to bi-1 on fn-931; then merge cap-719 (View plans), cap-720 (Manage a plan) and cap-shape-slice (Shape a slice) into cap-orchestrate-agent-work; their pages go.
+6. author-intent-page, rewrite of BI-9's page with its first Touches list: 12 lines (the capability and its 6 new features "adds"; fn-729, fn-806, fn-628, fn-730 and fn-795 "changes"); every other line kept.
+7. My checks: pages equal the approved drafts (Thin lines where the ICE is thin); the index gains and loses only what is named; the three old capabilities and their folders gone; BI-9's 12 Touches lines equal the index entries naming bi-9; no page names a removed id; structure check with no new error; no personal paths. Then the tree. Commit on "commit and cp".
+
+## The five lines changed first
+a. software-delivery-planning/turn-intents-into-work/capability.md line 72 (BI-1)
+b. features/fn-725/feature.md line 54
+c. features/fn-726/feature.md line 57
